{"version":1,"content":"<p>現年35歲的賭王三房千金何超蓮，素有「最美千金」之稱。</p><p>自2023年與內地男星竇驍於峇里島舉辦世紀婚禮後，她並未選擇隱退做少奶奶，反而展現極強事業心，除了經營社交平台分享生活，更積極開拓演藝事業，參演的新片《敦煌英雄》也即將上映。</p><p>&lt;br</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T04:20:32.028165+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":119,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-25T09:01:31+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-26T04:13:25.537332+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T04:13:25.537332+00:00","content_hash":"dce55f3083a79cfad0230fc7f26ee01f613e45e35a9fe56f194bbbe6cf046c05","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}